# The Observer's Notebook — Veronica Dietz

> Essays on identity, strategy, and the structural issues underneath what feels like a business problem.

Written by Veronica Dietz, founder of VD Advisory Group. Veronica works as a diagnostic strategist — a decision architect — helping identity-led founders locate the load-bearing issues underneath their business problems.

## About the Blog

The Observer's Notebook is where Veronica publishes long-form thinking on founder identity, business structure, strategic decision-making, and the patterns that keep capable operators stuck. Posts are adapted from episodes of The Aligned Edit podcast.

